The MIT License above covers the *reverse-engineering work in this
repository* — the annotated `KLAD.asm`, the helper scripts (`extract.py`,
`disasm.py`, `tobin.py`), the `Justfile`, the extracted text dumps under
`extracted/`, and the documentation.

The original game **КЛАД** (1987, version 1.4) is the work of E. Puysis-Puyshe
(Riga, Latvian SSR). All rights to the original program, its level designs,
and its on-screen text remain with the original author. The tape image
`tape/KLAD.RK` is included for reverse-engineering study only; this project
makes no claim of ownership over it. If you are the author or a rights
holder and wish for the tape image to be removed, please open an issue.
